## Implementation order

1. `OrderConfirmedPayload` (producer side) + `OrderConfirmedPublisher`
2. `OrderConfirmedPayload` (consumer side) + `OrderConfirmedListener`
3. `ProcessedEventStore` port + adapter (or reuse, if `persistence-architect` already built one)
4. Properties in `application.yml`
5. `DefaultErrorHandler` + `DeadLetterPublishingRecoverer` bean, once per consumer group
6. Integration test against a real broker (Testcontainers) — `40-testes.md`
